notes.content:
[list]
[*]We heard your prayers and added the possibility of skipping the game animation intro. Just press the «Space» button;
[*]From now on you can choose the convenient language prior to the start of the game;
[*]The Great Random factor had mercy on us all — the enemy allocation was simplified;
[*]The game route was prolonged and an Easter egg was dropped for the most resilient players.
[/list]
Endure!
Indie Ninjas team.
